<title>NETHERLANDS: A'DAM RUBBER 1996 NET MORE THAN HALVED.</title>
<headline>A'DAM RUBBER 1996 NET MORE THAN HALVED.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.0  vs   4.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.10 vs   0.15</p>
<p>    Turnover			     415.8  vs 409.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Food ingredients and rubber trader NV Rubber Cultuur</p>
<p>Maatschappij Amsterdam (Amsterdam Rubber) said that 1997 first</p>
<p>quarter results indicated that the 1997 full-year prospects were</p>
<p>promising.</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit of unit Catz	4.2  vs   2.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit unit Wurfbain     0.5  vs   5.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Last September, the company said it expected the 1996</p>
<p>second half net profit to be higher than the 0.5 million</p>
<p>guilders posted in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
